n\nEnter the entries of the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$ABC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The associative law changes the grouping while preserving factor order:\n\n$$\nABC=(AB)C=A(BC).\n$$\n\nThe intermediate $AB$ is $1\\times1$; $BC$ is $2\\times3$. Compute $AB$ first. For example, the first entry is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(AB)_{1,1} &=(-2)\\cdot(1)+(0)\\cdot(1) \\\\ &=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe complete product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n Now complete the product. For example, the first entry is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(ABC)_{1,1} &=(-2)\\cdot(-3) \\\\ &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe complete product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ABC &=(AB)C \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 6 & -6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717857 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d8b6699b-f789-55c5-9913-55cc4e29487f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717873}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d8b6699b-f789-55c5-9913-55cc4e29487f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717873} :answer-field/id #uuid "40f5c402-bb92-5980-9d96-f71ff09f6c37" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717855} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "47404218-5f28-5f21-8bfa-98aba6230260" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 175921