matrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-21 & -34\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717875 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b926cb40-1318-5b69-89b8-d2bc6b5f920f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717868}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b926cb40-1318-5b69-89b8-d2bc6b5f920f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717868} :answer-field/id #uuid "16a2fa81-3505-597c-b5ac-ffe42866e3df" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717850} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "224adbd5-e476-51c7-9f6f-43d9cfedc5ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717853}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "224adbd5-e476-51c7-9f6f-43d9cfedc5ea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717853} :answer-field/id #uuid "5eca4b9a-1f36-5bac-bf26-0fd458b1d4b4" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717858} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61fba291-f633-5ace-8192-d33d05438011" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717859}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "61fba291-f633-5ace-8192-d33d05438011" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717859} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1d6c905-7cd8-5bf7-8b61-91d79c73b333" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717872}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "f665d2f5-9df3-540c-b3bf-721c50e556b1" :question/problem "Calculate $ABC$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nEnter the entries of the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$ABC=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The associative law changes the grouping while preserving factor order:\n\n$$\nABC=(AB)C=A(BC).\n$$\n\nThe intermediate $AB$ is $3\\times2$; $BC$ is $1\\times1$. Compute $BC$ first. For example, the first entry is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(BC)_{1,1} &=(-1)\\cdot(1)+(-1)\\cdot(2) \\\\ &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe complete product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BC &=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n Now complete the product. For example, the first entry is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(ABC)_{1,1} &=(1)\\cdot(-3) \\\\ &=-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe complete product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ABC &=A(BC) \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186717880 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8dc37729-141f-5666-8a9b-a5ee0817db9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186717916}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8dc37729-141f-5666-8a9b-a5ee0817db9a" :answer/type {:db/id 